# CFD solver output: regenerable, and big.  Ignored BY DEFAULT, not banned --
# see "curated results" below.
#
# This repo stores *.cgns and *.log through Git LFS (.gitattributes), and that
# is working: all 53 tracked CGNS are 133-byte pointers in the object store,
# 7 KB in total for 1.385 GB of content.  So tracking a result costs the git
# history nothing; it costs LFS storage and bandwidth quota instead.
#
# CURATED RESULTS ARE TRACKED ON PURPOSE.  low_RE/'s outputs are in git because
# commit fca4212 ("Track curated results: DOCUMENTATION WORTHY, _14 meshes,
# drop .pw") deliberately put them there, and the ! lines below are how that was
# expressed.  These patterns are the default-off switch for the routine churn of
# a calibration sweep; when a result is worth keeping, add it explicitly:
#
#     git add -f high_RE/output_SAE/comp_corner_sa_edwards_000_surf.cgns
#
# NOTE the leading **/.  A gitignore pattern containing a slash anywhere but at
# the end is anchored to the directory holding the .gitignore, so the old
# "meshes/*" / "output_SA/*" matched nothing once the cases moved into low_RE/
# and high_RE/.  The **/ prefix makes them match at any depth.  (This anchoring
# was NOT the reason low_RE's results are tracked -- that was deliberate, and
# predates the reorganisation.  Ignoring a path never untracks what is already
# committed.)
**/meshes/*
**/output_SA/*
**/output_SAE/*
**/output_LST/*
**/doc_study/**/*.cgns
**/calibration/
!**/meshes/comp_corner_14.cgns
!**/meshes/comp_corner_14_fixed.cgns
!**/meshes/comp_corner_20.cgns
!**/meshes/comp_corner_20_fixed.cgns
!**/meshes/comp_corner_20_surf.fmt
!**/meshes/comp_corner_21.cgns
!**/meshes/comp_corner_21_fixed.cgns
!**/meshes/comp_corner_21_surf.fmt
!**/calibration/README.txt

# Figures and solver logs are small and are the record of what each grid did.
!**/output_SA/*.png
!**/output_SAE/*.png
!**/output_LST/*.png
!**/output_LST/*.csv

# WSL alternate-data-stream junk
*:Zone.Identifier

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Secrets — never commit these
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials*
.claude/
